# ---- Decompiled / copyrighted-by-Landfall artifacts ----
# refs/decompiled/ contains decompiled Assembly-CSharp source from Stick Fight:
# The Game (© Landfall). Used locally as a read-only reference; redistribution
# would be a copyright/DMCA risk. Each plugin's refs/ directory holds the
# Unity + BepInEx + Assembly-CSharp DLLs the plugin builds against — those are
# also copyrighted upstream. See README.md for how to obtain them locally.
refs/
*/refs/
**/refs/
# explicit: symlinked refs/ (sf-client-recon/refs -> sf-headless-host/refs)
sf-client-recon/refs

# ---- Build output ----
bin/
obj/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe
# Go test/build artifacts
*.test
*.out

# ---- Runtime ----
*.log
LogOutput.log
output_log.txt
*.sfreplay
/tmp-*

# ---- IDE / local agent ----
.claude/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user

# ---- macOS / Windows cruft ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Plugin assets we redistribute via README instructions ----
**/disabled-mods/
disabled-mods/

# ---- Notes copies that mirror source (de-duplicate against the live tree) ----
notes/recon/StickFightDedicatedSrv/
notes/recon/sf-netcodev2/
notes/recon/prior-memory/
notes/recon/sfdsrv*.log
notes/recon/BepInEx_*.log
notes/recon/baseline-lines.txt

# ---- Goldberg / Steam shim secrets ----
# (none currently, but pre-emptively guard against accidental commits)
steam_appid.txt
steam_settings/
account_name.txt
user_steam_id.txt

# ---- Control-plane / runtime secrets ----
*.env
sf-control.env
legacy/StickFightDedicatedSrv/smoke-test
smoke-test
__pycache__/

# SFLauncher build artifacts (not the dist/ release bundle, just the build tree)
deploy/SFLauncher/bin/
deploy/SFLauncher/obj/

# dist/ is the SHIPPED client bundle — track its contents even though
# they're binaries (overrides the global *.exe / *.dll ignores above).
!dist/*.exe
!dist/*.dll

# Third-party reference mod clones (have their own git history; reference only)
EditorExtension/
SFTGCNText/
TabInfo/
tools/external-mods/
# Large decompiled reference source
decompiled-working/

# Release staging (BepInEx binaries) — only the zipped artifact is tracked
release-build/
